    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262190/extras/6e393e05a8501484c0e4e3618191798e.poster.avif?t=1742462652\" width=100 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262190/extras/6e393e05a8501484c0e4e3618191798e.webm?t=1742462652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Help Lucas to get all the power gems in this journey while going throught 7 worlds to go back home. This game is a 2D platformer that you use weapons such as swords to defeat monsters and bosses. Note: This game still not finished.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262190/extras/6e393e05a8501484c0e4e3618191798e.poster.avif?t=1742462652\" width=100 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262190/extras/6e393e05a8501484c0e4e3618191798e.webm?t=1742462652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Help Lucas to get all the power gems in this journey while going throught 7 worlds to go back home. This game is a 2D platformer that you use weapons such as swords to defeat monsters and bosses. Note: This game still not finished.</p>",
    "short_description": "In this game, you play as Lucas, who is a student that gets teleported to a mysterious world by the Void. In this world he finds a sword, which he grab it to protect itseft agaist monsters and defeat bosses to get all 6 power gems. With these power gems, he soon will be at home again...",
